WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.464
Danger comes first.

00:00:01.464 --> 00:00:04.545
Confirm the area is safe before helping.

00:00:04.545 --> 00:00:15.638
Give care where the person is found unless traffic, flames, a slippery surface, falling objects or another hazard makes the location unsuitable.

00:00:15.638 --> 00:00:22.802
If so, promptly relocate the casualty to a clear, level place where care can continue safely.
